# Windrose configuration. Copy to .env and fill in only what you want.
# Everything here is OPTIONAL — with no keys at all, Windrose runs on delayed
# Yahoo Finance quotes and every panel works.
#
# Leave a line commented out (#) to mean "not configured". Do not leave a
# placeholder value uncommented — the app would treat it as a real key.

# ---- Live market data (Alpaca) ----
# Paper-trading keys work fine; the data API is separate from trading.
# Free at https://app.alpaca.markets  (Paper account -> API Keys)
#ALPACA_KEY=
#ALPACA_SECRET=

# ---- News headlines + analyst outlook (Finnhub) ----
# Free at https://finnhub.io/register
#FINNHUB_KEY=

# ---- Passcode for phone access (--lan). Auto-generated if left unset. ----
#WINDROSE_PIN=
